{"type":"message","id":"15dbdd2b","parentId":"a476be1a","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:20:27.825Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is running on a VM (Ubuntu) and the container name might not be \"openclaw\". Let me help them find the correct container name first.","thinkingSignature":"03967b1b7ff66340a45b423184010608edf8bea24834f24c41109091f07b0ffe"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n容器名字不对，先找你的容器：\n\n```bash\ndocker ps --format '{{.Names}}'\n```\n\n或者：\n\n```bash\ndocker ps -a | grep openclaw\n```\n\n拿到名字后再跑inspect。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":643,"output":77,"cacheRead":28224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28944,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780392022135,"responseId":"066dd357ecd65e944ca023ef86322dad"}}
