{"type":"message","id":"ee1f9f2a","parentId":"8e78cbe0","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:42:46.968Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User wants me to summarize the QNG update into a weekly report format. Let me write a proper 周报稿 based on the PRs info.","thinkingSignature":"3aa7f6e08094ebce1b6ff4c21bc8e5fd3915c6f66c94fe6d12ece288007d31d3"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**QNG 周报 · 2026-06-02**\n\n---\n\n**项目：** Qitmeer QNG\n**版本：** v2.3.0+dev\n**本周更新：**\n\n---\n\n**1. Relay Node 优化**\n支持自定义 Genesis 配置，适配私有网络/测试网部署场景。\n\n**2. MeerEVM 升级**\n升级至 v1.17.2，保持与上游 EVM 组件同步。\n\n**3. 版本信息增强**\n`-V` 参数新增显示完整 MeerEVM 版本，便于运维排查。\n\n---\n\n**变更性质：** 功能增强 + 维护性改进，不涉及链上数据结构调整，业务逻辑无影响。\n\n---\n\n要发到哪个渠道？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1149,"output":176,"cacheRead":35360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36685,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780414963262,"responseId":"066e2cf3f5128a8add10a48b6750a4a8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a29177e2","parentId":"ee1f9f2a","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:56:20.783Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6edb9f3d4ca0c2babe1db2e3f84\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-06-02 15:56 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6edb9f3d4ca0c2babe1db2e3f84]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 能稍微丰富一下么"}],"timestamp":1780415780736}}
{"type":"message","id":"c40f87f0","parentId":"a29177e2","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:56:25.918Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to expand/enrich the weekly report with more detail. Let me look at the PR descriptions more carefully and flesh them out with more context, background, and impact.","thinkingSignature":"9c31751c53a9684729bb3e48022f1acf4bced15583e045fa764f363971fc83fc"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**QNG 周报 · 2026-06-02**\n\n---\n\n**项目：** Qitmeer QNG\n**版本：** v2.3.0+dev-ad03e04（MeerEVM v1.16.9-q.0）\n**本周更新：**\n\n---\n\n**1. Relay Node · 自定义 Genesis 配置优化**\n\nRelay Node 是 QNG 网络中的关键组件，负责连接不同链环境、转发跨链消息。\n\n本次优化增强了 Relay Node 对自定义 Genesis 参数的适配能力，解决了在私有网络或定制链配置场景下启动失败、配置不兼容的问题。对于开发者和运维而言，后续在不同链配置环境下部署 Relay Node 将更加顺畅，减少因 Genesis 参数差异带来的额外适配工作量。\n\n**适用场景：** 开发测试环境、私有链部署、定制化 Qitmeer 网络\n\n---\n\n**2. MeerEVM · 升级至 v1.17.2**\n\nMeerEVM 是 QNG 兼容以太坊虚拟机的重要模块。本次从 v1.16.9 升级至 v1.17.2，同步了上游版本的主要更新，包括：\n- 已知问题修复\n- EVM 兼容性改进\n- 内部执行效率优化\n\n升级不涉及链上数据结构变更，现有业务逻辑完全兼容。\n\n---\n\n**3. 版本信息增强 · -V 参数优化**\n\n之前 `-V` 参数仅显示 QNG 版本，本次更新后同时展示 MeerEVM 完整版本号：\n\n```\n$ ./build/bin/qng -V\nqng version 2.3.0+dev-ad03e04\n(MeerEVM v1.16.9-q.0)\n(Go version go1.26.1)\n```\n\n便于开发者确认节点 EVM 环境版本，加速问题排查与部署验证。\n\n---\n\n**变更性质：** 功能增强 + 维护性改进，业务无侵入，兼容性无影响。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":555,"output":422,"cacheRead":36096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37073,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780415780849,"responseId":"066e3025659e5f3400b663c0c8d67be7"}}
