{"type":"message","id":"e59843ad","parentId":"e8258c99","timestamp":"2026-06-02T16:05:39.369Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The next_page_token is undefined. This means the API might not support pagination well, or I need to use a different approach. Let me try fetching blocks from a specific block_id onward, or try to get all blocks directly.\n\nActually, looking at the output - we have about 200 blocks already. The content so far covers:\n1. 代币定义\n2. ECHO发行曲线\n3. 种子奖池启动\n4. 通胀机制\n5. 燃烧机制\n6. 通缩调节阀\n7. 质押与罚没\n8. 争议仲裁\n9. 等级晋升\n\nI think I have enough to give a good summary. \n\nI'll take a different approach to extract the remaining blocks - maybe querying by specific parent IDs or using a different endpoint to get the table cell content would be more efficient than trying to paginate through everything at once.","thinkingSignature":"ec483d162bf9b1b6993fe1ffab5326671de95d20b38800558c87356e847180a4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_odq66ugxd6gg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst appId = 'cli_aa8198b425389cef';\nconst appSecret = JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json','utf8')).channels.feishu.accounts.main.appSecret;\n\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: appId, app_secret: appSecret });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    // Try with document_revision_id approach\n    const docReq = https.request({\n      hostname: 'open.feishu.cn',\n      path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/GBZCdbsrworrcHxGUEAcwVUCnBY/blocks?page_size=500',\n      method: 'GET',\n      headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token }\n    }, res2 => {\n      let data = '';\n      res2.on('data', c => data += c);\n      res2.on('end', () => {\n        const result = JSON.parse(data);\n        const items = result.data.items;\n        // Get block types summary\n        const typeCount = {};\n        items.forEach(b => { typeCount[b.block_type] = (typeCount[b.block_type]||0)+1; });\n        console.log('Block types:', JSON.stringify(typeCount));\n        console.log('Total blocks:', items.length, 'Has more:', result.data.has_more);\n        // Print all heading2 and heading3 titles\n        const headings = items.filter(b => b.block_type === 4 || b.block_type === 5).map(b => {\n          const text = b.heading2?.elements?.map(e=>e.text_run?.content).join('') || b.heading3?.elements?.map(e=>e.text_run?.content).join('') || '';\n          return text;\n        }).filter(Boolean);\n        console.log('Headings:', JSON.stringify(headings));\n      });\n    });\n    docReq.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":25008,"output":719,"cacheRead":27587,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53314,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780416328906,"responseId":"066e32495a15e4b8a8c2c65fb959db85"}}
